# Title: Hiding Files with Attrib.exe
# ID: 4281cb20-2994-4580-aa63-c8b86d019934
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: Sami Ruohonen
# Date: 2019-01-16
# Tags: attack.stealth, attack.t1564.001
# Description: Detects usage of attrib.exe to hide files from users.
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((cmdline:* +h *) AND ((process_name:*\\attrib.exe) OR (OriginalFileName:"ATTRIB.EXE"))) AND -((cmdline:*\\desktop.ini *)) AND -((parent_name:*\\cmd.exe AND cmdline:"+R +H +S +A \\\\\\*.cui" AND ParentCommandLine:"C:\\\\WINDOWS\\\\system32\\\\\\*.bat")))
